"7255",""
"7256","The Messenger of Allah ﷺ said, *""Come toward the pulpit,""* and we all came. When he climbed a step, he said, *""Āmīn""*, and when he climbed the second step he said, *""Āmīn""*, and when he climbed the third step he said, *""Āmīn.”* When he came down ˹after the sermon˺ we asked, ""O Messenger of Allah, we heard something from you that we had not heard before.""
