"7269",""
"7270",""
""And as for the narration of Muhammad ibn Abi 'Atiq, it is authentic."""
"7271",""
"7272",""
"7273",""
"7274",""
"7275",""
"7276",""
"7277",""
"7278",""
"7279",""
"7280","The Prophet ﷺ said: *“Whoever would be pleased that Allah prolong his life, expand his provision for him, and ward off from him an evil death, let him fear Allah and maintain the ties of kinship.”*"
"7281","Who will be pleased that their lifetime is extended and his ˹provisions˺ are increased, then he should ˹maintain good relations˺ with his relatives.""[^1]"
